  "description": "Gobardhan Panda, a researcher of the Bonda language, recites the Bonda origin myth as a poem he wrote in Bonda, and translates the stanzas into Odia. Prateek Pattanaik recorded it in 2018 for Remosam, a 2019 documentary by Subhashish Panigrahi. The footage wasn't used in the film, and it was edited and published under the Munaremo project in 2024. Subtitles are by Gobardhan Panda and Subhashish Panigrahi.",
